{"id":"83a4535946978ce2","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds.md","title":"Nondeterministic Time Complexity","display":"df-nondeterministic-time — Nondeterministic Time Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds","aliases":["73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds","73-df-nondeterministic-time"],"display":"df-nondeterministic-time — Nondeterministic Time Complexity","depends_on":["[[73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.1 and §11.2, print pp. 425–434, 487–492; PDF pp. 447–456, 509–514; local resource machinery","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§12.1–12.4, pp. 285–302; local total-decision asymptotic resource model","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds</span><span>73-df-nondeterministic-time</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nondeterministic-time — Nondeterministic Time Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98\" href=\"?note=2f2ad13d4f8c1f98\" title=\"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.1 and §11.2, print pp. 425–434, 487–492; PDF pp. 447–456, 509–514; local resource machinery"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§12.1–12.4, pp. 285–302; local total-decision asymptotic resource model"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (binary alphabet)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)\">\\(\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Run}_N\">\\(\\operatorname{Run}_N\\)</span> (nondeterministic TM and finite branches, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98\" href=\"?note=2f2ad13d4f8c1f98\" title=\"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (time bound)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}time}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NTimeBound}(N,t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\neg\\bigl(\\exists w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists\\rho:\\mathbb N\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n(\\rho(0)=C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\rho(i)\\leadsto_N\\rho(i+1)))\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n((|w|\\ge n_0\\land\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,\\rho))\\to m\\le c\\,t(|w|))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}time}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NTimeBound}(N,t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\neg\\bigl(\\exists w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists\\rho:\\mathbb N\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n(\\rho(0)=C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\rho(i)\\leadsto_N\\rho(i+1)))\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n((|w|\\ge n_0\\land\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,\\rho))\\to m\\le c\\,t(|w|))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}time}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NTIME}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\n\\exists N\\in\\{S:\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf2}(S)\\}\\;(\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)\\land\nL=L(N)\\land\\operatorname{NTimeBound}(N,t))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}time}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NTIME}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\n\\exists N\\in\\{S:\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf2}(S)\\}\\;(\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)\\land\nL=L(N)\\land\\operatorname{NTimeBound}(N,t))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first conjunct rules out infinite branches on every input, including the finitely many lengths below the asymptotic threshold. The prefix bound then forces every sufficiently long-input branch to stop within the stated time.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"2f2ad13d4f8c1f98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N$ with $\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)$ and $\\operatorname{Run}_N$ (nondeterministic TM and finite branches, see [[73-df-multitape-ntm-semantics]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf 2=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Run}_N","display":false},{"tex":"t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}time}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NTimeBound}(N,t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\neg\\bigl(\\exists w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\exists\\rho:\\mathbb N\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n(\\rho(0)=C_N^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\rho(i)\\leadsto_N\\rho(i+1)))\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\rho:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{NConf}_N\\;\n((|w|\\ge n_0\\land\\operatorname{Run}_N(w,m,\\rho))\\to m\\le c\\,t(|w|))\\bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nondeterministic\\text{-}time}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NTIME}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\n\\exists N\\in\\{S:\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf2}(S)\\}\\;(\\operatorname{NTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(N)\\land\nL=L(N)\\land\\operatorname{NTimeBound}(N,t))\\}","display":true}],"bytes":2347,"backlinks":[{"id":"ebe5483ba604bc90","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NTIME}$ (nondeterministic time classes, see [[73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds]])"},{"id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{time}_M,\\mathsf{DTIME}$ 见 [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]；$\\operatorname{NTimeBound},\\mathsf{NTIME}$ 见 [[73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-258","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds|Nondeterministic Time Complexity]]"}],"outgoing":["2f2ad13d4f8c1f98"]}